{"id":"angeblich","lemma":"angeblich","pos":"adv","rank":1721,"glosses":["allegedly, supposedly, reportedly, reputedly"],"ipa":"/ˈanˌɡeːplɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/31/De-angeblich.ogg/De-angeblich.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Sie hat ihn angeblich umgebracht.","en":"She allegedly killed him.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"him"},null,{"g":"to kill","l":"umbringen"}]},{"text":"Er ist angeblich schwer krank.","en":"They say that he is seriously ill.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"heavy, weighty"},{"g":"ill, sick"}]},{"text":"Angeblich hören Hunde besser als wir. Stimmt das?","en":"They say dogs hear better than we do. Is that true?","words":[null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)"},{"g":"dog, hound","l":"Hund"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"at the same moment"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"correct"},{"g":"the / that"}]},{"text":"Es ist jetzt angeblich wieder in Mode.","en":"It's in fashion again, apparently.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"now"},null,{"g":"again"},null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"in vogue, fashionable"]]},{"text":"Angeblich ist er der reichste Mann der Welt.","en":"It is said that he is the richest man in the world.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"rich, wealthy","l":"reich"},{"g":"man, male human being"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"world"}]}]}